  "description": "Delta C2000 vector control drive (built-in RS-485 Modbus): control and status words, output and display values, remote I/O and the communication parameters",
  "revision": 1,
  "source": "Delta, C2000 Series User Manual (DELTA_IA-MDS_VFD-C2000_UM_EN_20190213), chapter 12, Pr.09 address list",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "Delta Vector Control Drive C2000 Series User Manual",
      "version": "DELTA_IA-MDS_VFD-C2000_UM_EN_20190213",
