  "notes": [
    "A parameter GG-nn is the holding register 0xGGnn (Pr.04-10 is 0x040A). Functions 03, 06 and 10 are supported.",
    "Factory serial format is ASCII 7N2 at 9.6 kbit/s, station 1 (Pr.09-04 = 1). This map assumes RTU 8N2 (Pr.09-04 = 13), so set that parameter first.",
    "The control word (0x2000) and the fault word (0x2002) are listed as bit fields. To start the drive, write run and direction in one 0x2000 write.",
    "To control the drive over the link set the frequency source (Pr.00-20) and the operation source (Pr.00-21) to RS-485, then write 0x2001 or Pr.09-10.",
    "Pr.09-01 (baud rate) is not listed because its raw scale is not stated in the manual.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual; not tested on a device."
  ],
